      "settings": {
        "title": "About us",
        "text": "Fitness Superstore Inc. was founded in 2010 with the goal of becoming your one-stop shop for some of the biggest brands in gym equipment. \nWe offer brand new and remanufactured gym equipment \nfor home and commercial use.",
