        "text_EUqmfp": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>With 14 years of expertise, our mission is to deliver top-tier gym equipment at mid-range prices, distinguished by our renowned customer service, transparency, and integrity. We have a proven process, refined over years of dedication, ensuring quality is accessible to all without a hefty price tag. </p><p>Through standing by our mission, Fitness Superstore has become a brand trusted by thousands, driving an average of $15 million annual sales. Our company now has 100 employees, and is continuously growing.</p>",
